     phase3/full_runs/real_data/source/archive/quantum-groundstate-learning-6b8866b66d62aaf3ee815cd14fa58e9bf4629d66.tar.gz
       the archive of that commit as served by the hosting service (778170 bytes,
       SHA-256 13aa8e69c9bc614c72c5a415ecd889f113eabe95eec81e221174b3f14dedbb91).
       Its data files are serialized Python objects (pickle). Do not load them with pickle: use the
       converted files below, or the converter, which reads them as a stream of instructions and
