3. Records of a quantum processor

   The files calibration_snapshot.json under phase3/full_runs/qpu/jobs/ and phase3/full_runs/final_tests/jobs/
   are calibration data of the processor ibm_kingston as returned by IBM Quantum services at the time of each
   job. They are included as the record of the conditions of the author's own runs.

